# Tasks: Scenario 1 — Room Setup & Lobby

**Spec**: `speckit.specify` | **Plan**: `speckit.plan` | **Date**: 2026-06-04

---

## Phase 1: Foundational — Shared Infrastructure

**Purpose**: Fix the baseline bug and extend shared types that all user stories depend on. Must be complete before any story work begins.

**⚠️ CRITICAL**: No user story work can begin until this phase is complete.

- [ ] T001 Fix API base URL bug in `frontend/src/services/api.ts` L22 — remove `/bug` suffix so default resolves to `http://localhost:3001`
- [ ] T002 Extend `RoomStatus` type in `backend/src/models/game.ts` from `"lobby"` to `"lobby" | "game" | "results"`
- [ ] T003 Add `hostId: string` field to `Room` interface in `backend/src/models/game.ts`
- [ ] T004 Add `hostId: string` field to `RoomSnapshot` interface in `backend/src/models/game.ts`
- [ ] T005 [P] Mirror `RoomSnapshot` changes in `frontend/src/services/api.ts` — add `hostId: string` and extend `status` union type

**Checkpoint**: Types compile cleanly. Both `npm run build` in `/backend` and `/frontend` pass with no type errors.

