## Dependencies & Execution Order

```
Phase 1 (T001–T005)          ← must complete first, blocks everything
    │
    ├── Phase 2 (T006–T011)  ← US1: Create Room (P1, start here)
    │       │
    │       └── Phase 3 (T012–T016)  ← US2: Join Room (P1, can overlap with Phase 2 on backend)
    │               │
    │               ├── Phase 4 (T017–T020)  ← US3: Polling (P2)
    │               │
    │               └── Phase 5 (T021–T027)  ← US4: Start Game (P2, backend + frontend in parallel)
    │                       │
    └───────────────────────└── Phase 6 (T028–T033)  ← Validation & commit
```

### Parallel opportunities
- T005 (frontend type mirror) can be done in parallel with T003–T004
- T013 (schema tests) can be written in parallel with T012 (schema changes)
- T023 (startRoom tests) can be written in parallel with T022 (startRoom implementation)
- T028–T031 (builds + tests) can all run in parallel once implementation is done
- T025–T026 (frontend API + store for start) can be done in parallel with T021–T024 (backend start endpoint)

